 an ID that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is unique to the entire document. This attribute group is not used for a required id","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attribute, or for an id attribute that specifies an id reference.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"id"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The value of this element.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"value"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Whether the fermata is upright or inverted. Upright if not specified.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"kind"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For most elements, any program will compute a default x and y position. The position","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attributes let this be changed two ways.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"position"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The font attribute group gathers together attributes for determining the font within a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credit or direction. They are based on the text styles for Cascading Style Sheets. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"font-family is a comma-separated list of font names. The font-style can be normal or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"italic. The font-size can be one of the CSS sizes or a numeric point size. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"font-weight can be normal or bold. The default is application-dependent, but is a text","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"font vs. a music font.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"font"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"color"}],"kind":"parameters"}],"metadata":{"title":"init(id:value:kind:position:font:color:)","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL10MXLFermataV2id5value4kind8position4font5colorACSSSg_AC5ShapeOAA